      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OSPREY CHRONOS (5) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from eight starts. Missed the frame latest (23.23) when fifth over 400m at Gawler in a Other. Looks suited here and rates on top. HERE COMES RHEA (1) turned in a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 342m behind Sailaway Buddy (20.07) in a Other. Placed at her previous run. The form out of her last race has been franked. Better than the latest run and deserves another chance. FANCY IN DESIGN (4) was below best at her last start when 6th at this track following a win (19.79) there two back. Solid record here at the distance winning 15 races. Expected to run well. ADHANA PHILLIP (2) comes into calculations after placing most recently.",
